34"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2089697969033658701","created_at":"2026-08-18T12:56:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089697969033658701"],"id":"2089697969033658701","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2702,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《牛来》这件事最值得思考的，其实不是它拍得有多粗糙，而是：这样一部主要靠两个人、没有专业制作团队、花了5年“手搓”出来的动画电影，最终真的拿到了国家电影局公映许可证，进入了院线。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2089697969033658701"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2089689303454798054","created_at":"2026-08-18T12:22:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089689303454798054"],"id":"2089689303454798054","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2418,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实我一直很“厉害”的，只是没被人看出来而已。\n“厉害”是需要很长时间的。\n我总觉得前方有什么东西在等着我。\n在我迷茫的时候，是大道指引了我。\n大道至简！","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2089689303454798054"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2089569158396854348","created_at":"2026-08-18T04:24:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089569158396854348"],"id":"2089569158396854348","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4108,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2089246644382614006","type":"quoted"}],"text":"差一点哈，总之别看着杀跌又慌了！现在上证的4000就像当年的3000一样，来回纠缠，爱恨情仇。你需要做的就是像个渣男一样，不停地摩擦就好，认真不得。 https://t.co/qZvDtgjvMO","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2089569158396854348"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2089561452336283976","created_at":"2026-08-18T03:54:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2089561452336283976"],"id":"2089561452336283976","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":3708,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":9},"text":"先修得内心安稳与丰盈，再去奔赴一段关系。自当沉稳而后爱人，爱是自身满溢后才能流动的物质。爱，是有余力后的馈赠，而非无路可退的依赖。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2089561452336283976